AGPL-3.0 §13 corresponding-source offer: adds a permanent, unauthenticated
"Source code" link to the sign-in/sign-up page, pointing at the public mirror
repo (github.com/GetMidasAI/twenty-fork-public). See docs/twenty-fork-policy.md
for why this is a core-file patch rather than a custom-app-framework extension
(the app framework only renders inside the authenticated workspace shell).

Apply from the twenty-fork/ root: git apply PATCHES/0001-agpl-source-link.patch

